  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bale Onion Producers&apos; Union Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Onion production and marketing, Beneficiaries: 457 (75 women), Description: Strengthen the Union&apos;s capacities to deliver good quality services to its groups&apos; members. The focus is the construction of infrastructure including large diameter wells, compost pits, and storage silos, irrigation equipment, supply of inputs (seeds, fertilizers), technical training and organization of marketing/ sales.</narrative>
  </description>
